  "license_note": "Item ids follow the published checklist. Every prompt here is a paraphrase; the official wording is linked, not bundled.",
  "notes": "Use for parallel-group randomised trials. Randomised crossover, cluster, non-inferiority, and pilot trials have separate CONSORT extensions that this base checklist does not cover.",
  "items": [
